what up space fame goes in here from  anime upper back at it again to discuss  the latest and craziest developments in  the one piece story and this is a huge  one right before a very long break four  weeks to be specific so stay tuned for  this upcoming insanity that is this full  translated chapter and a lot of things  that we were confused about in the  spoilers were thankfully addressed in  the full translator pages so we got a  lot of that to go over if you do enjoy  these one-piece reviews and want to keep  them coming you know what to do channel  parking with it and smash that like  button remember smashing his pirating  energy and passing his other energy so  choose wisely and set off those youtube  fireworks to celebrate juano's  liberation if you haven't joined the  nakamura by subscribing and hitting that  notification bell to turn on all  notifications or you will miss future  one-piece videos and updates and now  without further ado let's jump into it  spoilers and all we got one piece on the  cover of weekly shonen jump as they  advertise the new movie showing shanks's  daughter and everything then we finally  see the color two page spread that we  knew was coming advertising the new  one-piece odyssey game it definitely  looks fun and i may have to just try  this one so this chapter is called the  new emperor's as we know and it starts  with the five elders freaking out over  what is the meaning of this photo  meaning luffy's photo we never approved  of it they say and they thought they  told the marines to remove the d from  the name this was one of my questions  after reading the spoilers as we'll see  the bounty for luffy is not as high as  we had every right to expect and so at  first i thought this was because they  were trying to downplay luffy but then  the spoiler said that luffy's new form  was used and i thought if they want to  downplay luffy the warrior of liberation  who can give hope to the downtrodden  that it didn't make sense that they'd  reveal his awakened form to everyone and  now it all makes sense the five elders  didn't want to reveal luffy's new form  or the d in his name they want to keep  it as hush-hush as possible so of course  they'd be against this photo very  satisfied now because this discrepancy  was bothering me when we lacked all the  information the marine says no sir we  weren't told about that the photo was  sent by cp zeros guernica sama who of  course didn't have all the knowledge  that the elders had the elder says  reprint it the world cannot be permitted  to see this the marine says they've been  trying to contact the printer but  there's no use the elder wants them to  cease distribution but then we see big  news morgan's the goat i love this dude  so much and you know he doesn't care  about what the elders want he says it's  up to us to spread this around the globe  cipher pulls transmission from wano  broke off right after they spotted big  mom's ship the gears of the world he  says won't stop turning he won't let the  elders propaganda slide when the real  story is this thrilling this dude is  legit a hero absolutely love it this is  what news outlets should strive to be we  see people reading the news which speaks  of the defeat of the emperor's big mom  and kaido by the three supernova  captains they were all issued an  extraordinary bounty by the government  we're told although not that  extraordinary in my opinion for luffy 3  billion apiece now for kin and law fans  this is hype since they are being put on  equal footing with luffy all the info of  how luffy soloed kaido is not out and  yes he soloed him for all intents and  purposes it makes sense that maybe they  don't know the full story so they just  looked at it as three supernova taking  down to yonko and that's that or perhaps  more likely when we hear what the elders  were on about the marines are  downplaying luffy but either way they  mistakenly added his new form again i am  disappointed that luffy's bounty is not  over kaido's because he definitely  deserves it to be but now it does make  sense why it's not higher given the  context of the full translator pages  shout out to manfred ng who on my  luffy's new bounty video wrote i'm  looking at 3 billion when i asked  everyone to guess what luffy's new  bounty would be i do personally wish it  was higher but i gotta give props to the  good guests again as i mentioned in my  spoiler video i like how the total of  their bounties is 9 billion their  collective bounties are a bit higher  than kaido and big mom's collective  bounties to symbolize how they together  surpassed them but it's definitely  misleading since i'll just say it luffy  did more and deserves a higher bounty  than law and kit we then see the wano  party and luffy has shown partying and  eating to his heart's content with  chopper and yamato it's a great panel  and much deserved after the epic but  difficult arc luffy just had to endure  brooke is rocking out with hiri a very  nice touch i love that combo meanwhile a  bunch of you guys asked where robin was  in the comments of the last few videos  and we finally see her she's underground  and we find out through a conversation  with tengu a bunch of crazy jaw-dropping  things we find out that tengu was  imprisoned here for a number of years he  did swordsmithing as a hobby because he  had a talent for it but in actuality he  was the former shogun kozuki tsukiaki  aka odin's father we see him take off  the mask for the epic reveal and  everything my brother animak when the  spoilers dropped was wondering why he  didn't try and help odin if he was alive  he was wondering how they'd explain this  and again it's answered here even when  the spoilers are confusing we should  trust oda to explain it well when the  full chapter drops the reason he didn't  help odin was because he was locked away  in this underground room in particular  by the time he got out of the prison  odin was already dead and wano changed  he contemplated seppuku but didn't go  through with it his exact explanation is  interrupted by robin robin interrupts to  talk about another huge thing the  ancient weapon pluton she says this  legendary warship called the world's  worst warship capable of destroying  whole islands in a single shot should be  here in wano and odin's dad confirms  she's right that is huge and that's  something we have to look forward to  when the manga comes back seeing pluton  but for now we move on to the former  prisoner mine in udon roots are coming  from the ground and impaling the former  beast pirates and draining them visibly  it's even happening to king and queen  again we don't know what shape they were  in before this happened but it's still  pretty crazy that green bull the admiral  can take them all down together so  easily the dude is not breaking a sweat  and these are two yonko commanders it  appears he doesn't need to eat since he  can just absorb nutrients like this from  others green bull says himself that he's  at a rank where he'd lose face if he let  a few commanders like king and queen get  the best of him big talk and a reminder  as to just how much of a threat the  admirals are greenville says the navy  doesn't have manpower to waste on the  mess they've left and even insults them  saying not that i expected much of you  bozos this guy is being so patronizing  to serious antagonists of this last arc  that it's really hyping up the marines  as a force to be reckoned with not that  that wasn't clear before but oda is  really emphasizing it here he's also  drinking alcohol from barrels another  potential nod to the green bowl is  zoro's relative theory we do see his  face here though and he's definitely not  a dead ranger for zorro in appearance he  is however from wano clearly since he's  introduced as ryokugyu aramaki and  aramaki is a japanese wano name he lets  whoever is on the phone know that he's  in wano and he says bring a warship he  even says don't tell sakazuki aka kainu  so it suggests that he's hiding  something but we don't know what just  yet then he says he's always dug his  style no half measures he's itching to  get his approval and then seeing luffy's  poster he says he's sure to get an atta  boy if he brings him the brat's head so  i'm guessing he might be talking about  akainu here and wants to surprise and  impress him with luffy but i'm not  completely sure he's talking about  akainu and not someone else let me know  your thoughts in the comments i will say  though based on looks and based on  outwardly saying he wants someone's  approval and an atta boy he doesn't seem  very zoro-esque let me know upon seeing  this do you still think greenville's  related to zorro or does the theory die  for you here for now we return to the  party we get a flashback of what looks  like luffy saying to momo to not tell  anybody about him since he doesn't want  to be a hero so epic i love this dude  doesn't need any of the glory he's just  doing the right thing and as we saw way  back in the beginning of the story he's  totally okay with normal people viewing  him as a pirate to be hated i love that  he doesn't expect gratitude from other  people he just does what he thinks is  the right thing to do kid shows up and  attacks luffy and luffy unintentionally  counters without even meaning to by  pulling him close like he wants kid to  party with him again luffy is clearly  giving off the pirate king laid back  energy here while kidd is so reactionary  the party scenes are amazing and we even  see signs reminiscent of the ones inel  has except for him it's three comma-like  designs rather than just two this is  proclaimed to be the biggest and wildest  festival finally kid tells luffy came to  kill luffy because wait for it they've  announced the four emperors and luffy is  one of them and kid has not this  confused me at first because why would  luffy have the same bounty as law and  kid while the other two didn't even make  yonko while the great buggy d clown did  but i'm guessing this part is the work  of morgan's who knows more even if the  government doesn't want to give luffy  the glory through an extra large bounty  so yeah the new yonko are here shanks  blackbeard luffy and shanks's old fellow  pirate apprentice on the pirate king's  crew buggy the clown this of course  raises questions immediately about what  buggy did to earn this title but for now  let's just appreciate the fact that our  boy buggy made it all this way this dude  said he'd be the pirate god if luffy  were to become the pirate king and you  gotta admit he appears to be backing his  big talk up i'm definitely not gonna  criticize buggy becoming an emperor  until we know more about it for now i'll  just relish the news the chapter ends  with greenville approaching the  celebration and saying the marines  aren't in such a good mood especially  since the rest of the world is a real  mess now we're told times are changing  and also we're told about the four week  breakout is taking very hyped stuff so  many cliffhangers to leave us wanting  more i feel like oda did it because he  knew four weeks would be a lot of time  off and he definitely gave us a chapter  packed to the brim as a result let me  know your thoughts on this chapter  luffy's bounty and our surprise yonko  the great buggy drop a hashtag all hail  buggy in the comment section if you're a  real one and watch to this point if you  enjoy these one piece reviews and want  to keep them coming you know what to do  chiller parking with an end smash that  like button with no mercy remember  smashing his power king energy and  passing his orochi energy so choose  wisely and set off those youtube  fireworks to celebrate juano's  liberation if you haven't joined the  nakama by subscribing and hitting that  notification bell to turn on all  notifications or you will miss future  one-piece videos and updates while you  wait for the excruciating four weeks to  pass until the next chapter feel free to  check out my growing and big one piece  playlist that includes videos on all the  yonko warlords admiral supernova and  much more link to that is in the  description and until next time see ya  space cowboys

